ote":"Outdoors, Hammershøi's stillness turns into empty streets, lone houses and low grey skies, so I looked for places that hold still the way his rooms do. Start with Cazin's October Day, and end on the Hammershøi so you can carry the hush back inside. I passed over the brighter Impressionists (Sisley, Twachtman, Vuillard): too much colour and too much weather.","artworks":[{"id":"aic:876","source":"aic","nativeId":"876","title":"October Day","artist":"Jean Charles Cazin","date":"1890–93","imageThumb":"https://www.artic.edu/iiif/2/3ef69544-a84c-dfa4-df6a-346b4b59c351/full/843,/0/default.jpg","imageHires":"https://www.artic.edu/iiif/2/3ef69544-a84c-dfa4-df6a-346b4b59c351/full/1686,/0/default.jpg","license":"CC0","sourceUrl":"https://www.artic.edu/artworks/876","accession":"1894.1039","medium":"Oil on canvas","dims":{"width":2733,"height":2250},"color":{"h":40,"s":27,"l":35}},{"id":"aic:181558","source":"aic","nativeId":"181558","title":"Rue de la Montagne-Sainte-Geneviève near the Intersection of Rue LaPlace (Rue de la Montagne-Sainte-Geneviève prés de carrefour de la rue LaPlace)","artist":"Charles Marville","date":"1865/69","imageThumb":"https://www.artic.edu/iiif/2/76d6a66a-4276-3966-e9aa-90d74f04cd3e/full/843,/0/default.jpg","imageHires":"https://www.artic.edu/iiif/2/76d6a66a-4276-3966-e9aa-90d74f04cd3e/full/1686,/0/default.jpg","license":"CC0","sourceUrl":"https://www.artic.edu/artworks/181558","accession":"2003.121","medium":"Albumen print","dims":{"width":2679,"height":3138},"color":{"h":37,"s":21,"l":87}},{"id":"aic:81507","source":"aic","nativeId":"81507","title":"House of Mère Bazot","artist":"Charles François Daubigny","date":"1874","imageThumb":"https://www.artic.edu/iiif/2/68e24e96-1f25-75cd-bb2c-232713f131a9/full/843,/0/default.jpg","imageHires":"https://www.artic.edu/iiif/2/68e24e96-1f25-75cd-bb2c-232713f131a9/full/1686,/0/default.jpg","license":"CC0","sourceUrl":"https://www.artic.edu/artworks/81507","accession":"1922.405","medium":"Oil on canvas","